{
  "maps": {
    "328": {
      "name": "Champion",
      "events": {
        "2": {
          "name": "Blue",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN. You made it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I've been thinking about what to say",
                    "since Victory Road. Since Saffron.",
                    "Since Pallet Town, honestly."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I have the Master Ball. I have the",
                    "Championship. And I have a plan."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Reform the League. No more secrets.",
                    "No more sealed caves and hidden gods.",
                    "And deal with Mewtwo -- openly,",
                    "honestly, with the authority to act."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 12},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN. You came back."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I knew you would. The difference",
                    "between me and Giovanni is that I'm",
                    "asking you to stop me if I'm wrong."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "He never gave anyone that option."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So if you still think I shouldn't",
                    "have this -- come take it from me.",
                    "That's how we'll know."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "2": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 918},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I became Champion for one reason.",
                    "To be the last person standing",
                    "between you and Cerulean Cave."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Not because I hate you. Because I",
                    "love you, and I watched someone just",
                    "like you destroy himself."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Does this feel like the right choice?",
                    "Because it felt like the right choice",
                    "to Giovanni, too. Every single time."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "3": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 918, "variable_id": 162, "variable_value": 12},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN. Again."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You keep coming back. I don't know",
                    "if that's courage or stubbornness."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It doesn't matter. I'll fight you",
                    "every time. As many times as it takes."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Because that's what you do for someone",
                    "you love."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "4": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 850},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN. You're back."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The plan hasn't changed. The League",
                    "is different now -- more honest.",
                    "Cerulean Cave is on the agenda."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But you still want the Ball."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Alright. Same terms. Come take it."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "5": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 425},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You win."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 9,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 25,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Congratulations, \\PN. You're the",
                    "new Champion."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 28,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You've grown so much since Pallet",
                    "Town. You've come of age."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 32,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\V[12]... I know what you were trying",
                    "to do. And I understand why."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 35,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You wanted to protect people. That's",
                    "never wrong. But the way matters as",
                    "much as the reason."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 38,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Remember that. Both of you."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 43,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN -- your victory wasn't just your",
                    "own doing. The bond you share with",
                    "your Pokémon carried you here."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 58,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN. Come with me."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "6": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 425, "switch2_id": 12},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I couldn't stop you. I tried."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 26,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN... you've won. You're the",
                    "new Champion."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You've grown so much since Pallet",
                    "Town."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 33,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\V[12]... you fought well. I'm proud",
                    "of you. And I'm sorry."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 36,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Promise me something. When you open",
                    "that cave... if you catch yourself",
                    "sounding like Giovanni --"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 39,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Please stop. Even if it feels right.",
                    "Especially if it feels right."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 44,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN -- whatever happens next...",
                    "come back. Okay?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 59,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN. Come with me."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "7": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 425, "switch2_id": 918},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I couldn't stop you. Again."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 26,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN... you're the Champion. Again."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I don't know what else to say."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 33,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\V[12]... you did your best. That's",
                    "all anyone can ask."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 36,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Some battles can't be won by fighting.",
                    "Some people have to find their own way."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 39,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I still believe \\PN will. Eventually."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 44,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN -- I'll be in Pallet Town. When",
                    "it's over. If you want to talk."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 59,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN. Come with me."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "8": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 425, "switch2_id": 918, "variable_id": 162, "variable_value": 12},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I couldn't stop you. I never could."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 26,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN... Champion again."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "At this point, I don't think",
                    "anything I say will change your mind."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 33,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\V[12]... thank you for trying."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 36,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You fought for what you believed in.",
                    "Nobody can fault you for that."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 39,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Not even me."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 44,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN -- whatever happens in that cave...",
                    "I hope you find what you're looking for."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 59,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN. Come with me."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
